Lets start scoping out phase 1 and break it into manageable steps.
Let's break Phase 1 into two tracks that can mostly run in parallel — infra/auth setup, and the gsb-core library — converging at the end for an integration proof. I'll add this as a new section in Design.md so it stays part of the living document.

